[0,"o","\u001b[1;34m########################################################################################################################\u001b[0m\u001b[1;34m    Exercise: UID-Based Access Control\u001b[0m"]
[0.000177,"o","                                                                                  \u001b[1;34m        Requirements\u001b[0m                                                                                                    "]
[0.000021,"o","\u001b[1;34m          Hosts: servera (server), workstation (client)\u001b[0m"]
[0.000231,"o","                                                                 \u001b[1;34m          Prerequisite exercise: Configure an NFS Server\u001b[0m                                                                \u001b[1;34m          Give two users their own directories on one share and prove each reaches only their own\u001b[0m"]
[0.000194,"o","                       \u001b[1;34m        Steps\u001b[0m                                                                                                           \u001b[1;34m          1. On servera, create two groups and two users with explicit UIDs and GIDs\u001b[0m"]
[0.00006,"o","                                    "]
[0.000203,"o","\u001b[1;34m          2. Create a directory for each group, owned by it, that only its members can enter\u001b[0m                            \u001b[1;34m          3. Export the parent directory to the subnet\u001b[0m                                                                  "]
[0.000151,"o","\u001b[1;34m          4. On workstation, create the same groups and users with the same UIDs and GIDs\u001b[0m                               "]
[0.000205,"o","\u001b[1;34m          5. Mount the export on workstation\u001b[0m                                                                            \u001b[1;34m          6. As each user, verify you can use your own directory but not the other\u001b[0m                                      "]
[0.000181,"o","\u001b[1;34m########################################################################################################################\u001b[0m"]
